export default "<div class=\"container mx-auto px-4 py-12 max-w-4xl\">\n  <article class=\"prose prose-lg dark:prose-invert max-w-none\" aria-labelledby=\"lookup-guide-title\">\n    <h2 id=\"lookup-guide-title\" class=\"text-2xl font-bold mb-4\">Using username search responsibly</h2>\n    <p class=\"text-muted-foreground mb-8\">This site helps you review your own public usernames, compare handles for a brand, and follow up on possible matches. It is an independent service; a matching username alone does not identify a person.</p>\n    <section class=\"mb-8\">\n      <h3 class=\"text-xl font-semibold mb-3\">Start with a handle you know</h3>\n      <p class=\"text-muted-foreground\">Enter the username without a profile URL. Use the same spelling first, then check variants you have actually used. A nickname shared by several people can produce unrelated matches. Search your own accounts or use the service with permission and a lawful purpose.</p>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"mb-8\">\n      <h3 class=\"text-xl font-semibold mb-3\">Understand the results</h3>\n      <p class=\"text-muted-foreground\">A found result is a lead to a public profile, not proof of ownership. Open the original platform and compare public details before drawing conclusions. A not-found result does not guarantee that a name is available to register: reserved names, login requirements, rate limits and network errors can affect checks.</p>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"mb-8\">\n      <h3 class=\"text-xl font-semibold mb-3\">Use the filters and export</h3>\n      <p class=\"text-muted-foreground\">Filter by platform category and result status to review relevant matches. Keep a short record of the platform, URL and what you verified. Exported files can contain personal information; store them carefully and do not publish a list of someone else's accounts. Provider-flagged adult results are excluded.</p>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"mb-8\">\n      <h3 class=\"text-xl font-semibold mb-3\">Check coverage and freshness</h3>\n      <p class=\"text-muted-foreground\">Coverage and response time depend on the data provider and each platform. Some services change their URLs or block automated requests. Check important results directly on the platform. The directory explains selected platforms; it is not a promise that every service can be checked successfully on every search.</p>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"mb-8\">\n      <h3 class=\"text-xl font-semibold mb-3\">Privacy and AI analysis</h3>\n      <p class=\"text-muted-foreground\">Queries are sent to the lookup providers needed to answer them. If you use AI analysis, the context you submit is processed by an external AI provider. Avoid passwords, private messages and sensitive personal details. AI suggestions can be wrong and do not verify identity. Read the privacy policy for data-use information.</p>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"mb-8\">\n      <h3 class=\"text-xl font-semibold mb-3\">Act on verified findings</h3>\n      <p class=\"text-muted-foreground\">For accounts you own, update security settings or request deletion through the original platform. Report suspected impersonation through that platform's reporting tools. This site cannot recover passwords, access private accounts, prove that two profiles belong to one person, or continuously monitor an account.</p>\n    </section>\n  </article>\n</div>\n";
